0sdphase|Byte Lane 0 - Slave DLL phase|BYTE 0||||This parameter contains the DQS Phase after tuning. Default value is 0. Coarse position: Phase delay (7 steps: 0 to 6). Possible values are: Reported Index: 0 (36 degrees) Reported Index: 1 (54 degrees) Reported Index: 2 (72 degrees) Reported Index: 3 (90 degrees) (default value) Reported Index: 4 (108 degrees) Reported Index: 5 (126 degrees) Reported Index: 6 (144 degrees) Please use the DDR Tuning feature of STM32CubeMx DDR Test Suite to get tuned values for your hardware design.
