0r0dgps|Byte Lane 0 - DQS gating phase select fine tuning|BYTE 0||||This parameter contains the DQS gating phase select fine tuning. Default value is 2. Valid values are: 0 (clk180) 1 (clk270) 2 (clk0) (default value) 3 (next clk90) Please use the DDR Tuning feature of STM32CubeMx DDR Test Suite to get tuned values for your hardware design.
0r0dgsl|Byte Lane 0 - DQS gating system latency fine tuning|BYTE 0||||This parameter contains the DQS gating system latency fine tuning. Default value is 3. Valid values are: 0 (No extra clock cycles) (default value) 1 (1 extra clock cycle) 2 (2 extra clock cycles) 3 (3 extra clock cycles) 4 (4 extra clock cycles) 5 (5 extra clock cycles) Please use the DDR Tuning feature of STM32CubeMx DDR Test Suite to get tuned values for your hardware design.
